WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:08.801
The Tang Monk was crying quietly.

2
00:00:08.802 --> 00:00:11.417
"Wukong was right to warn us.

3
00:00:11.418 --> 00:00:15.811
Those nice villagers turned out to be demons!"

4
00:00:15.812 --> 00:00:18.318
Strong ropes tied him to a column.

5
00:00:18.319 --> 00:00:21.163
Bajie and Wujing were tied up too.

6
00:00:21.164 --> 00:00:29.281
"We should have listened to Wukong," Wujing said, struggling to break free.

7
00:00:29.282 --> 00:00:34.275
Bajie twisted in his ropes and shouted, "Villains! Evil demons!

8
00:00:34.276 --> 00:00:37.785
How dare you kidnap us! You'll regret it!

9
00:00:37.786 --> 00:00:40.895
Our good friend, Sun Wukong, will find us!

10
00:00:40.896 --> 00:00:45.656
He's really powerful—even the Jade Emperor is afraid of him!"

11
00:00:45.657 --> 00:00:48.307
Just then his stomach growled.

12
00:00:48.308 --> 00:00:50.380
The Tang Monk frowned.

13
00:00:50.381 --> 00:00:54.564
"Bajie, how can you think about food right now?"

14
00:00:54.565 --> 00:00:59.690
Wujing shook his head. "That's terrible, Bajie."

15
00:00:59.691 --> 00:01:04.623
"I can't help it," Bajie said, continuing to struggle with his ropes.

16
00:01:04.624 --> 00:01:07.691
"I haven't eaten anything today."

17
00:01:07.692 --> 00:01:11.943
The Tang Monk watched Bajie and Wujing squirm wildly.

18
00:01:11.944 --> 00:01:14.522
"Do you think you can break free?"

19
00:01:14.523 --> 00:01:21.976
Bajie grunted. "My ropes are getting loose."

20
00:01:21.977 --> 00:01:28.685
Bajie's yells echoed through the cave.

21
00:01:28.686 --> 00:01:34.394
Several small demons in the kitchen heard him and ran into the throne room.

22
00:01:34.395 --> 00:01:37.259
The Demon of Black Rain glared at them.

23
00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:40.780
"What are you doing? I'm starving!

24
00:01:40.781 --> 00:01:45.333
Why aren't you getting ready to cook the Tang Monk?"

25
00:01:45.334 --> 00:01:48.423
One small demon held up a bowl of spices.

26
00:01:48.424 --> 00:01:50.891
"We are getting ready to cook him, Master!

27
00:01:50.892 --> 00:01:55.063
But the prisoners know Sun Wukong, the Monkey King!"

28
00:01:55.064 --> 00:01:58.424
The Demon of Black Rain yawned.

29
00:01:58.425 --> 00:02:03.559
"Yes, I heard that noisy pig shouting."

30
00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:06.589
"What will we do?" the small demon asked.

31
00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:12.493
"Sun Wukong is powerful. He once defeated Heaven's entire army!"

32
00:02:12.494 --> 00:02:15.378
"Even the Jade Emperor is afraid of him! If

33
00:02:15.379 --> 00:02:21.398
we eat the Tang Monk, Sun Wukong will attack us," another demon said. A

34
00:02:21.399 --> 00:02:27.937
third demon shuddered. "Maybe we shouldn't eat the Tang Monk!" The

35
00:02:27.938 --> 00:02:30.673
Demon of Black Rain held up a hand. "We

36
00:02:30.674 --> 00:02:34.292
will eat the Tang Monk and live forever. I'm

37
00:02:34.293 --> 00:02:38.177
not afraid of Sun Wukong. Swift

38
00:02:38.178 --> 00:02:42.056
Wing knows someone who can help." A

39
00:02:42.057 --> 00:02:47.233
bird demon gasped. "I do?" The

40
00:02:47.234 --> 00:02:49.450
Demon of Black Rain nodded. "You

41
00:02:49.451 --> 00:02:56.398
told me you saw a goddess who was more powerful than Sun Wukong." A

42
00:02:56.399 --> 00:03:01.008
small demon gasped, and he dropped the bowl of spices. "More

43
00:03:01.009 --> 00:03:05.010
powerful than Sun Wukong?" The

44
00:03:05.011 --> 00:03:08.463
small demons looked eagerly at Swift Wing. "Where

45
00:03:08.464 --> 00:03:13.027
is this goddess, Swift Wing?" the Demon of Black Rain asked. "I'd

46
00:03:13.028 --> 00:03:15.818
like to meet her." "Um,

47
00:03:15.819 --> 00:03:22.958
you can't," Swift Wing said. "She's in another world." The

48
00:03:22.959 --> 00:03:25.792
Demon of Black Rain stood up. "You

49
00:03:25.793 --> 00:03:30.487
must know how to get there. Tell me how!" Shaking,

50
00:03:30.488 --> 00:03:35.544
Swift Wing quickly recited a spell. Light

51
00:03:35.545 --> 00:03:40.331
sparkled and then— zoomp! An image appeared.

52
00:03:40.332 --> 00:03:44.988
The image showed a strange kingdom with tall buildings.

53
00:03:44.989 --> 00:03:50.533
"That's where the goddess is," Swift Wing muttered.

54
00:03:50.534 --> 00:03:57.710
"Amazing," the Demon of Black Rain whispered. "The image looks so real."

55
00:03:57.711 --> 00:04:04.056
"It is real," Swift Wing said with a sigh.

56
00:04:04.057 --> 00:04:07.374
"The spell opens a portal to that world.

57
00:04:07.375 --> 00:04:11.788
You can simply step through, and you'll be there."

58
00:04:11.789 --> 00:04:16.557
Crash! A door exploded, and Bajie ran into the throne room.

59
00:04:16.558 --> 00:04:22.653
"I won't let you harm my—Whoa!"

60
00:04:22.654 --> 00:04:34.823
Bajie tripped on the bowl and stumbled through the portal, which closed behind him. Zoomp!

